{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0302","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:00000234:text","row":39752,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「よう」","en":"“Hey.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904465","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00001","en":"Sakuraba: \"Yo.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:0000025c:text","row":39753,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「ほれ」","en":"“Here.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904466","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00002","en":"Taichi: \"Here.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:0000027c:text","row":39754,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"マスクを渡した。","en":"I handed him a mask.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904467","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00003","en":"I handed him a surgical mask.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:0000032a:text","row":39755,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「ＯＫ」","en":"“Okay.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904468","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00004","en":"Sakuraba: \"O.K.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:0000034a:text","row":39756,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"何の疑問も持たずにつけた。","en":"He put it on without question.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904469","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00005","en":"He put it on, not one doubt or question.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:00000402:text","row":39757,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「腹が減った」","en":"“I’m hungry.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904470","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00006","en":"Sakuraba: \"Hungry.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:00000430:text","row":39758,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「食ってないのか？」","en":"“You haven’t eaten?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904471","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00007","en":"Taichi: \"Haven't eaten then?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:000004e2:text","row":39759,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「一時間目の授業に備えている」","en":"“I’m preparing for first period.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904472","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00008","en":"Sakuraba: \"Readying for first period class.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:00000520:text","row":39760,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「……カレーパンを食うのが授業なのか」","en":"“...What, you’re taking Curry Bread 101?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904473","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00009","en":"Taichi: \"...is the subject curry bread perhaps?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["omission","mistranslation"],"assessment":"Taichi asks whether eating curry bread counts as a class. The English turns curry bread itself into a school subject and omits the act of eating.","remedy":"Is eating curry bread your first-period class?","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":47,"start":12,"text":"is the subject curry bread perhaps?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:000005e4:text","row":39761,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「カレーパンがなくなるその日まで」","en":"“Until the day the curry bread runs out.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904474","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00010","en":"Sakuraba: \"Until that day when curry bread itself has finally passed.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","word_choice"],"assessment":"Sakuraba says he will continue until the day the curry bread runs out or is gone. 'Has passed' suggests death, passage, or an examination and does not express depletion.","remedy":"until the day the curry bread runs out","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":68,"start":26,"text":"when curry bread itself has finally passed"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:0000061e:text","row":39762,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"クールに決めた。","en":"He played it cool.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904475","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00011","en":"Cooly resolved.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","typography"],"assessment":"The Japanese says he delivered or struck the pose coolly. The English misspells 'coolly' and changes presentation into making a resolution.","remedy":"He delivered the line coolly.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":15,"start":0,"text":"Cooly resolved."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:00000646:text","row":39763,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"記録通りに。","en":"Exactly as recorded.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904476","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00012","en":"Just as in the records.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:00000672:text","row":39764,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「レトルトのカレーでも食ってればいいじゃないか」","en":"“Then eat some curry from a pouch.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904477","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00013","en":"Taichi: \"Wouldn't you like to eat some retort pouch curry too?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["register_voice","addition","mistranslation"],"assessment":"Taichi dismissively says Sakuraba could simply eat packaged curry instead. The English turns it into a polite question about desire and adds 'too.'","remedy":"Why don't you just eat some packaged curry?","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":62,"start":9,"text":"Wouldn't you like to eat some retort pouch curry too?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:00000740:text","row":39765,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「カレーは嫌いだ」","en":"“I hate curry.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904478","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00014","en":"Sakuraba: \"I hate curry.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:0000076a:text","row":39766,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"記録通りだ。","en":"That, too, was in the records.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904479","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00015","en":"Just as recorded.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:0000078e:text","row":39767,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"どんどん成就していく。","en":"The predictions kept coming true.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904480","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00016","en":"They're becoming real one after the other.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:000008e9:text","row":39768,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「ヘックス！」","en":"“Hexchoo!”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904481","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00017","en":"Sakuraba: \"Heh-cks!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:00000917:text","row":39769,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「……六角形の惨劇」","en":"“...The hexagonal tragedy.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904482","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00018","en":"Taichi: \"...the Tragedy of the Hexagons.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:00000943:text","row":39770,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"これも記録にあった。","en":"That had been in the records too.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904483","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00019","en":"This was also in the records.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:0000096f:text","row":39771,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"発生率は、今まで確認しただけでも１５％以上。","en":"From what I’d seen so far, it happened at least fifteen percent of the time.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904484","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00020","en":"Rate of occurrence up to present has been just confirmed to be 15% or more.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:000009b3:text","row":39772,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"七回に一度は、鼻汁橋をぶち込まれる計算だ。","en":"By that math, one time in seven he’d nail me with a Snot Bridge.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904485","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00021","en":"My calculations say that once in seven times I will be struck with a Nasal Discharge Bridge.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:000009f5:text","row":39773,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"だが過去の偉い人（俺）は、マスクを装着させることで回避する術を編み出した。","en":"But a great man of the past (me) had devised a way around it: make him wear a mask.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904486","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00022","en":"However, a celebrated personage of the past (me) has worked out an appropriate avoidance technique via installation of a mask.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:00000add:text","row":39774,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「……マスク、取っていいか？」","en":"“...Can I take the mask off?”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904487","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00023","en":"Sakuraba: \"...is it OK if I take off the mask?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:00000b1b:text","row":39775,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「それは許可できない」","en":"“Permission denied.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904488","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00024","en":"Taichi: \"That cannot be allowed.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:00000bcf:text","row":39776,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「つらいな……人生は」","en":"“Life... is hard.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904489","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00025","en":"Sakuraba: \"So harsh... this human life.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0302:00000c05:text","row":39777,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺が言いたいよ」","en":"“You’re telling me.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904490","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0012:00026","en":"Taichi: \"That's what I'd like to say!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
